# Unit12
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2024红宝书考研英语词汇
# 描述: 基础词Unit12核心词汇

delicious/dɪˈlɪʃəs/美味的/The food at this restaurant is delicious.
deliver/dɪˈlɪvər/递送；发表/The postman delivers mail every morning.
demand/dɪˈmænd/要求；需求/There is a great demand for skilled workers.
democracy/dɪˈmɑːkrəsi/民主/Democracy gives people the right to vote.
demonstrate/ˈdemənstreɪt/证明；示范/The experiment demonstrates the theory.
dense/dens/浓密的；密集的/The forest is very dense in this area.
deny/dɪˈnaɪ/否认/He denied any involvement in the crime.
department/dɪˈpɑːrtmənt/部门/She works in the marketing department.
depend/dɪˈpend/依赖；取决于/The result depends on your effort.
deposit/dɪˈpɑːzɪt/存款；押金/You need to pay a deposit for the room.
depress/dɪˈpres/使沮丧；使萧条/The bad news depressed everyone.
deprive/dɪˈpraɪv/剥夺/War deprived many children of education.
describe/dɪˈskraɪb/描述/Can you describe what happened?
desert/ˈdezərt/沙漠/The Sahara is the largest desert in the world.
deserve/dɪˈzɜːrv/应得/She deserves the award for her hard work.
design/dɪˈzaɪn/设计/She designs clothes for a famous brand.
desire/dɪˈzaɪər/欲望；渴望/He has a strong desire to succeed.
desk/desk/书桌/She sat at her desk and began to work.
desperate/ˈdespərət/绝望的；不顾一切的/He made a desperate attempt to save the child.
despite/dɪˈspaɪt/尽管/Despite the rain, the game continued.
destination/ˌdestɪˈneɪʃn/目的地/Paris is a popular tourist destination.
destroy/dɪˈstrɔɪ/摧毁/The earthquake destroyed many buildings.
detail/ˈdiːteɪl/细节/Please explain the plan in detail.
detect/dɪˈtekt/发现；探测/The sensor can detect tiny changes in temperature.
determine/dɪˈtɜːrmɪn/决定；确定/Hard work determines your success.
develop/dɪˈveləp/发展；开发/The city has developed rapidly in recent years.
device/dɪˈvaɪs/设备；装置/A smartphone is a useful device.
devote/dɪˈvoʊt/致力于/She devoted her life to education.
dialogue/ˈdaɪəlɔːɡ/对话/The dialogue between the two leaders was productive.
diamond/ˈdaɪəmənd/钻石/She wore a beautiful diamond necklace.
diary/ˈdaɪəri/日记/She keeps a diary every day.
dictate/dɪkˈteɪt/口授；命令/The boss dictated a letter to his secretary.
die/daɪ/死亡/Many plants die in the winter.
diet/ˈdaɪət/饮食/She follows a healthy diet.
differ/ˈdɪfər/不同；意见不合/Opinions differ on this issue.
digest/daɪˈdʒest/消化；摘要/It takes time to digest a heavy meal.
digital/ˈdɪdʒɪtl/数字的/Digital technology has transformed our lives.
dilemma/dɪˈlemə/困境/He faced a moral dilemma.
dimension/daɪˈmenʃn/维度；尺寸/The room's dimensions are 5 by 3 meters.
dinosaur/ˈdaɪnəsɔːr/恐龙/Dinosaurs became extinct millions of years ago.
direct/dəˈrekt/直接的；指导/She gave direct instructions to the team.
direction/dəˈrekʃn/方向/He walked in the direction of the park.
dirty/ˈdɜːrti/脏的/Your hands are dirty; please wash them.
disability/ˌdɪsəˈbɪləti/残疾/People with disabilities deserve equal opportunities.
disappear/ˌdɪsəˈpɪr/消失/The ship disappeared in the fog.
disappoint/ˌdɪsəˈpɔɪnt/使失望/The exam results disappointed him.
disaster/dɪˈzæstər/灾难/The flood was a natural disaster.
discipline/ˈdɪsəplɪn/纪律；学科/Mathematics is a challenging discipline.
discount/ˈdɪskaʊnt/折扣/The store offers a 20% discount on all items.
discover/dɪˈskʌvər/发现/Columbus discovered America in 1492.
